# 1. Ignore Node.js dependencies in ANY folder or subfolder
**/node_modules/

# 2. Ignore environment variables/secrets in ANY folder
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# 3. Optional: Ignore build or distribution outputs if you generate them later
**/dist/
**/build/

# 4. Optional: System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

